# Frontend Environment Variables
#
# VITE_API_URL — Base URL for all API requests.
# - Local development: leave UNSET (Vite dev-server proxy handles /api → localhost:5000)
# - Production build:  set to the full backend origin + /api path
#
# Example (Render):
#   VITE_API_URL=https://your-backend.onrender.com/api
